<title>UK: Household Bank sets $400 mln seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Household Bank sets $400 mln seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK NEVADA</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.655    ISS PRICE  99.655    FULL FEES   27.5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/SING  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    17.5 BP   SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
